      "readme": "Friends dataset: fMRI data of naturalistic TV viewing and recall\n\nThis dataset includes 23 participants who viewed and recalled a two-part episode of Friends (season 1, ep 16-17). Data were collected in 10/2021 to 1/2023. See paper for accompanying details: \n\nThe original published study investigated how causality (in narratives) affected behavioral recall and neural outcomes.\n\nPlease contact James Antony (james.ward.antony@gmail.com) if you have any questions or observe irregularities in the data. \n\nPlease also see my Github folder for accompanying code: https://github.com/JamesWardAntony/friends.",
